      "writtenOn": "2017-04-03T14:07:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The signature is completely controlled by the vendor. If they implement this, they will also provide the key which gets send to the phone and passed through the system server as a byte[] to here.\n\nI changed above to \"vendor defined signature\"",
