        "id": 1000866
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-04-03T16:16:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So, the signature is provided by the vendor and only ever interpreted by the vendor?  Does it only get passed around in the framework as a sort of cookie?\n\nWho does the signature originate with?  From another HAL?",
      "parentUuid": "2ab532c1_40b86b7c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 33,
        "startChar": 8,
